    "created_at": "2016-09-01T16:28:34Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-01T16:28:34Z",
    "body": "They must be configurable to avoid violating ES's internal method invariants, since their values can change when navigation occurs.\n\n(The internal method invariants are violated anyway for web compat reasons, as noted in the spec, but I believe that's a separate issue.)\n\nMaybe we should add a note here.\n",
